{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:9.45.050","page_type":"section"},"citation":"9.45.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","content_hash":"eedf3da4b51247c32c3d61b51a178cd77f090f4e30ab0c15b79030d027e069ad","heading":"Residential picketing.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.050:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to engage in picketing which is directed, focused or targeted at a residence and which takes place before or about that residence.\n(b) A person is engaged in residential picketing if the person, with or without a sign, is posted at, before or about a particular residence.\n(c) Nothing in this section shall prohibit the picketing of a residence which is used as a place of business or a place of public assembly.\n(d) Any person violating this section may be punished by:\n(1) A fine of not more than $499.00;\n(2) Imprisonment in jail for not more than 179 days; or\n(3) Both such fine and imprisonment not to exceed the limits set out in subsections (d)(1) and (d)(2) of this section. (Ord. 16548 §§ 1 – 4, 2-2-93. Code 1995 § 54-126.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"4362bd74-0aa8-5ce4-92c4-4e7c677d7781"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","content_hash":"ef3aca0415096b926841959449d164aa6725e2036c0f7d8b8c31a6b0c24c5ad3","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.050:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to engage in picketing which is directed, focused or targeted at a residence and which takes place before or about that residence.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"c2d336c8-4b1c-552a-82a6-4c077bc883ea"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","content_hash":"b9355a860d5934beb43dd1c696b0e5eefd2ddae7ad35f748d512d82cf050f9c1","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.050:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","text":"(b) A person is engaged in residential picketing if the person, with or without a sign, is posted at, before or about a particular residence.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"196776b2-c0a3-5e82-86f5-0e522b9d026c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","content_hash":"e862405aec3a46dcece1771672d103e223e7bd13c15cd59ed0e1f921719d3d65","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.050:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","text":"(c) Nothing in this section shall prohibit the picketing of a residence which is used as a place of business or a place of public assembly.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"c14a42dc-367c-5182-bdff-e3f6bd2fbfbf"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.050","content_hash":"62e9cceb78a56265ba6ab8d7b53e37a56105e0cfeeb3171947afa2d8120930b0","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:m